  itemId: block_seed_planter
  displayName: Seed Planter
  description: One-metre irrigated soil tray for a single crop. Right-click with
    a seed to plant, right-click again when it is ripe to harvest, and fertilize
    once with biomass or Organic Fertilizer for faster growth and a bonus unit. Water
    it with a Sprinkler or a water source within six metres. Reports its crop to
    any Farm screen on the same construct.
